tests/go-lint.json includes the pinned go-jsonnet linter/testdata/*.jsonnet inputs.
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). These development-only
fixtures are excluded from the published package. lint.mbt and lint_children.mbt
adapt lexical-use and eager local-cycle analysis from linter/internal/variables,
linter/internal/traversal and internal/parser/context.go at that same revision.
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

tests/go-ast.json includes formatter/testdata/empty_comment.jsonnet and
formatter/testdata/regular_expression.jsonnet from that pinned go-jsonnet revision.
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). These inputs exercise raw
parsing and source retention, not formatter output, and are excluded from the package.

lint_type_*.mbt adapt conservative type-graph inference, checks and declarations
from linter/internal/types at the same pinned go-jsonnet revision.
lint_lower.mbt adapts analysis-only lowering from internal/program/desugarer.go.
token.mbt, lexer_number.mbt and the lexer/parser diagnostic and operator-token paths adapt
internal/parser/lexer.go and parser.go at the same revision.
string_literal.mbt adapts internal/parser/string_util.go at that revision;
normal quoted strings are validated and decoded when consumed by the parser.
Numeric literal spelling and deferred overflow follow ast/ast.go and the
LiteralNumber evaluation path in interpreter.go at the same pinned revision.
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
tools/embed-lint-stdlib.mbtx verifies the reference revision and source hash.

lint_quote.mbt, lexer_number.mbt rune quoting and lint_print.mbt adapt Go 1.24.0 src/strconv/quote.go and
src/strconv/isprint.go. Copyright 2009 The Go Authors. All rights reserved.
BSD 3-Clause terms: licenses/GO-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
tools/embed-lint-print.mbtx verifies the exact source SHA-256 before extraction.

manifest_toml.mbt, manifest_yaml.mbt and manifest_text.mbt adapt the native
TOML/YAML rendering contracts and control flow in the pinned go-jsonnet
builtins.go and interpreter.go to MoonBit, including quoting and key recognition.
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

stdlib_source.mbt embeds the Jsonnet standard-library source from the pinned
go-jsonnet astgen/stdast.go above. Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0
(see LICENSE and the original header embedded in stdlib_source.mbt).
tools/embed-stdlib.mbtx verifies the reference revision and extracts the source;
stdlib_layer.mbt selects supported definitions. This Jsonnet source is evaluated
by MoonJsonnet's own MoonBit interpreter; no Go interpreter is required at runtime.

