MoonBit core is provided by the user's toolchain, not vendored here.

source_range.mbt and parser.mbt source-span, local-binding and parameter range rules follow
go-jsonnet v0.21.0 ast/location.go, ast/ast.go, internal/parser/parser.go and
internal/program/desugarer.go at commit
67968688d9952f50662e979fab1bef889d0d3e57:
https://github.com/google/go-jsonnet/tree/v0.21.0
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Repeated parameter binding and default selection in eval.mbt follow go-jsonnet
value.go checkArguments and thunks.go closure.evalCall at that same revision.

formatter*.mbt (except formatter_sort*.mbt) implement formatting rules from internal/formatter,
internal/parser/lexer.go and internal/parser/string_util.go at the same pinned go-jsonnet revision.
Copyright Google Inc.; Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). This partial native
formatter does not bundle or invoke Go at runtime.

formatter_sort.mbt, formatter_sort_partition.mbt and formatter_sort_pivot.mbt
adapt the exact unstable sort.Slice path from Go 1.24.0 src/sort/slice.go,
zsortfunc.go and sort.go. Copyright 2009, 2017, 2022 The Go Authors. All rights reserved.
BSD 3-Clause terms: licenses/GO-BSD-3-Clause.txt. This preserves observable
equal-key import ordering and does not invoke a Go runtime.

internal/yaml contains the syntax/event parser from moonbit-community/yaml.mbt,
commit e2f1129249a7cc707aa1c9c39bd8bfe207c93821 (0.0.7 source):
https://github.com/moonbit-community/yaml.mbt
Copyright 2025 International Digital Economy Academy. MIT terms are retained in
licenses/YAML-MIT.txt. Parser::next_token is exposed for bounded event consumption;
the plain-scalar colon rule follows go-yaml v2. The dependency's JSON schema
resolver and emitter are not used.

